# round 87 (w105): the SAMPLED store against the single parsimonious point. Job 2623 draws ten OptGPSampler points per deletion around its own optimum (growth fixed at 0.99 of it, thinning 10) and writes the per-reaction mean and the mean with the per-reaction spread appended. These arms read those stores exactly as the point store is read. Reads fixed here: six seeds on the released split against the pFBA point 0.911 and the point with rule counts 0.918, and the five folds against 0.920. Submitted with a dependency on the store build.
